      "content": "okay so the McKinsey and HBR stuff sounds good, but even those studies get criticized for having flaws, like like they don't always prove causation—maybe profitable companies just happen to hire more diverse people? i've also seen some reports saying these initiatives can actually cause friction or lower productivity in certain teams. what does the research say about those downsides?",
